sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App
    participant SSOT as SSOT (Ch 3)
    participant Srv as Server (authoritative)
    participant PSP as PSP SDK

    App->>SSOT: generate + persist idempotency key (Ch 15/8)
    User->>App: tap Place order
    App->>Srv: placeOrder(cart, options, idempotencyKey) authed (Ch 19)
    Srv->>Srv: authoritative price/tax/shipping/stock (Ch 23)
    Srv->>PSP: charge (tokenized)
    alt requires auth (SCA/3-DS)
        PSP-->>App: requiresAuth -> present challenge
        App->>PSP: complete challenge -> confirm
    end
    PSP-->>Srv: charge confirmed (async/webhook)
    Srv-->>App: confirmed order (REAL state)
    Note over App,Srv: retry with SAME key -> server dedups -> same order, NO double charge, Ch 15
